# --- General Files to Ignore ---

# macOS system files
**/.DS_Store
**/*._*

# R Project files
**/.Rproj.user
**/.RData
**/.Rhistory
**/.Rapp.history
**/.Renviron
**/.Rprofile

# Execution and Log files
**/*.err
**/*.out
**/*.log

# Python cache
**/__pycache__/

# Generated file indexes
**/*.fai

# Snakemake dry-run output
**/dryrun*.txt

# Editor workspace files (personal)
**/*.code-workspace

# Specific Notebooks
test_merge.ipynb


# --- Directories to Ignore ---

# Snakemake internal files
**/.snakemake/

# Pattern-matched result folders
**/results*/

# Log directories
**/test_logs/
**/logs/
**/scripts/clinical_data/

# Large data / pipeline output dirs
**/nextclade/
**/augur/
**/augur_nextclade/
**/Augur_Bootstraps/
**/THD_calculations_local/
**/subclonal_muation_distribution/
**/test_data/
**/*_results/
**/SarsCov2_gisaid_CH_21_22/

# Only THD_calculations/workflow_rawReads is the tracked pipeline; the rest
# of THD_calculations/ (loose scripts, sibling legacy "workflow" pipeline,
# stray alignment file) is not
THD_calculations/*.R
THD_calculations/*.r
THD_calculations/*.aln
THD_calculations/workflow/
